Package: varm
Title: Fast Vector Autoregressions and Local Projections with an Rcpp Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Kostas", family = "Vasilopoulos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "k.vasilopoulo@gmail.com")
Description: Frequentist and Bayesian vector autoregressions (VAR), structural
    identification, and local projections (LP) with a C++ (Rcpp/RcppArmadillo)
    engine. MCMC samplers (Minnesota conjugate and hierarchical priors,
    stochastic-volatility triangular Gibbs, shrinkage priors, TVP-VAR) run
    entirely in compiled code.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://kvasilopoulos.github.io/varm, https://github.com/kvasilopoulos/varm
BugReports: https://github.com/kvasilopoulos/varm/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0), generics, ggplot2, rlang, splines, stats,
    tibble, tidyselect
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), vars, BVAR, lpirfs, bsvars,
    svars, sandwich, mvtnorm, spelling
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Language: en-US
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
